{"id":"855f0d0656844c14","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-partial-equivalence-relation.md","title":"Partial equivalence relations","display":"df-partial-equivalence-relation — Partial equivalence relations","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-partial-equivalence-relation","aliases":["72-df-partial-equivalence-relation"],"display":"df-partial-equivalence-relation — Partial equivalence relations","depends_on":[],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998, ISBN 0-444-89840-9","source_location":"Chapter X, section 3.9, printed pp.746,748 / PDF pp.758,760","source_statement_checked":true,"verification_status":"definition-contract-checked; source-statement-checked","proof_status":"not-applicable-definition","source_proof_status":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-partial-equivalence-relation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-partial-equivalence-relation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-partial-equivalence-relation — Partial equivalence relations"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998, ISBN 0-444-89840-9"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Chapter X, section 3.9, printed pp.746,748 / PDF pp.758,760"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked; source-statement-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 是固定集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq T\\times T\">\\(R\\subseteq T\\times T\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"xRy\">\\(xRy\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\">\\(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\)</span>。下式引入元语言谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PER}_T\">\\(\\operatorname{PER}_T\\)</span>、集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PER}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{PER}(T)\\)</span>、支撑 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|R|\">\\(|R|\\)</span>、等价类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[x]_R\">\\([x]_R\\)</span> 与商集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|R|/R\">\\(|R|/R\\)</span>；类记号仅用于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in|R|\">\\(x\\in|R|\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PER}_T(R)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ R\\subseteq T^2\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall x,y\\in T\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\Rightarrow \\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R)\\bigr)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall x,y,z\\in T\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\land \\langle y,z\\rangle\\in R\\Rightarrow \\langle x,z\\rangle\\in R)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PER}_T(R)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ R\\subseteq T^2\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall x,y\\in T\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\Rightarrow \\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R)\\bigr)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall x,y,z\\in T\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\land \\langle y,z\\rangle\\in R\\Rightarrow \\langle x,z\\rangle\\in R)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PER}(T)\\coloneqq\\{R\\in\\mathcal P(T^2):\\operatorname{PER}_T(R)\\},\\qquad\n|R|\\coloneqq\\{x\\in T:\\langle x,x\\rangle\\in R\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PER}(T)\\coloneqq\\{R\\in\\mathcal P(T^2):\\operatorname{PER}_T(R)\\},\\qquad\n|R|\\coloneqq\\{x\\in T:\\langle x,x\\rangle\\in R\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"[x]_R\\coloneqq\\{y\\in T:\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R\\}\\quad(x\\in|R|),\\qquad\n|R|/R\\coloneqq\\{[x]_R:x\\in|R|\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[[x]_R\\coloneqq\\{y\\in T:\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R\\}\\quad(x\\in|R|),\\qquad\n|R|/R\\coloneqq\\{[x]_R:x\\in|R|\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本书用 PER 表示“类型的成员及成员相等”：整体项集合上不要求自反，支撑上的限制才是等价关系。若 xRy，由对称性及传递性得 xRx、yRy，故等价类确实落在支撑内；空关系对应空类型，不应排除。查重已覆盖72目录及glossary，旧类型原子没有可复用的PER签名。本节点是原书语义接口的显式集合论展开，不引入Nuprl的全部推导规则。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq T\\times T","display":false},{"tex":"xRy","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PER}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PER}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"|R|","display":false},{"tex":"[x]_R","display":false},{"tex":"|R|/R","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in|R|","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PER}_T(R)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ R\\subseteq T^2\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall x,y\\in T\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\Rightarrow \\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R)\\bigr)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall x,y,z\\in T\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\land \\langle y,z\\rangle\\in R\\Rightarrow \\langle x,z\\rangle\\in R)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PER}(T)\\coloneqq\\{R\\in\\mathcal P(T^2):\\operatorname{PER}_T(R)\\},\\qquad\n|R|\\coloneqq\\{x\\in T:\\langle x,x\\rangle\\in R\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"[x]_R\\coloneqq\\{y\\in T:\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R\\}\\quad(x\\in|R|),\\qquad\n|R|/R\\coloneqq\\{[x]_R:x\\in|R|\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":2055,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-324","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-partial-equivalence-relation|df-partial-equivalence-relation — Partial equivalence relations]]"},{"id":"d79ea25f75d5218c","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$R\\subseteq T^2$，$t,u,r,v,w\\in T$；$\\operatorname{PER}_T$ 见 [[72-df-partial-equivalence-relation]]。下式引入 Kleene 相等 $\\simeq_{\\mathfrak e}$、值相容性 $\\operatorname{VR}_{\\mathfrak e}$、集合 $\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)$ 及任意关系的预求值扩张 $R^{\\Downarrow}$。这些是元语言关系，不是项语法中的相等公式。"},{"id":"9e7370aef3007b80","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 [[72-df-evaluation-respecting-per]] 的 $\\mathfrak e=\\langle T,\\Downarrow\\rangle$ 与 $\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)$，以及 [[72-df-partial-equivalence-relation]] 的 $|E|$。"},{"id":"2e1cc33090ad6f68","anchor":"ref-39","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-partial-equivalence-relation]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-324","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-partial-equivalence-relation|df-partial-equivalence-relation — Partial equivalence relations]]"},{"id":"f6f38fb4ec14b41d","anchor":"ref-39","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-partial-equivalence-relation]]"}],"outgoing":[]}